    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Downey McCarthy are delighted to offer to the market this bright and spacious two bedroom top floor apartment within the well located River Towers development on the Lee Road, in Cork. A superb investment opportunity (not rent capped), or first time buy, viewing comes highly recommended. \r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of reception hallway, open plan kitchen/dining/living area, two spacious bedrooms, one en suite bathroom and the main bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Reception Hallway - 6.16m x 1.38m \r\nA timber door allows access into the reception hallway. The hallway has laminate timber flooring, one centre light piece, two wall-mounted light fittings, a press area for storage and water tank, one electric radiator, and a hatch allows access up to the fully floored attic space.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Kitchen/Dining/Living - 6.0m x 5.43m \r\nThe open plan kitchen/dining/living area has two windows overlooking the side of the property allowing in extensive natural light, extensive dining space, one television point, recessed spot lighting, neutral décor, timber flooring, and one large electric radiator.\n\nThe kitchen features solid fitted units at eye and floor level, extensive worktop counter, tile splashback, integrated oven/hob/extractor fan, a stainless steel sink, plumbing for a washing machine, space for a dryer, and space for fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 2.68m x 4.27m \r\nA spacious double bedroom has one window overlooking the side of the property, timber flooring, one centre light fitting, one electric radiator, built-in wardrobe unit for storage, and a door allowing access to the en suite. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 1.49m x 1.9m \r\nThe en suite features a three piece suite including a built-in shower cubicle incorporating a Mira Vigor electric shower. The room has one frosted window overlooking the side of the property, fully tiled walls and floors, one wall-mounted light piece, one centre light fitting, and a towel rail.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.08m x 4.27m \r\nThis double bedroom has one window overlooking the side of the property, timber flooring, one centre light fitting, one electric radiator, built-in wardrobe unit for storage, and a Stira staircase allows access up to the fully floored attic space. \r\n\r\nMain Bathroom - 1.69m x 2.36m \r\nThe main bathroom features a three piece suite, fully tiled floors, one centre light fitting, one extractor fan, towel rail, one wall-mounted light piece, and neutral décor. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Approx. 65.56 Sq. M. / 706 Sq. Ft.\r\nBuilt in the year 2000\r\nBER C3 - BER no. 111282612\r\nElectric heating\r\nTwo spacious double bedrooms \r\nFloored attic space\r\nDesignated parking space no. 517\r\n20 minutes’ walk to University College Cork \r\n10 minutes’ drive to Cork city centre\r\nEasy access to N22 road network\r\nRental potential €2,000 per month\r\nProperty was owner occupied\r\nNo rent cap in place\r\nManagement fees €1,600 per annum"
      },
      {
